{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868730/extras/f990bbdeb9bb1956839bd55e75ef2dec.avif?t=1752630228\" alt=\"says the word about, with tops on either side that look like downward arrows\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868730/extras/7d894f72b9b297dd2f7653d4f7cd824c.poster.avif?t=1752630228\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868730/extras/7d894f72b9b297dd2f7653d4f7cd824c.webm?t=1752630228\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868730/extras/7d894f72b9b297dd2f7653d4f7cd824c.mp4?t=1752630228\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>On My Way Out</strong> is a heartwarming adventure game about trying to leave the house as a spinning top.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You play as <strong>Culver</strong> - an agoraphobic top whose friends are waiting at the front gate for you, they have a surprise. You told them you\u2019ll be down in 5 minutes but that was 5 minutes ago, lucky for you they\u2019ll wait for as long as it takes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Outside your house is a daunting world waiting to be explored. Spin, dive and bash your way through forests, lakes and mountains, uncover the secrets this world holds, recover stolen artifacts, and meet your neighbors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868730/extras/f11971ab6ccc8d223b2a987733c50d40.poster.avif?t=1752630228\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868730/extras/f11971ab6ccc8d223b2a987733c50d40.webm?t=1752630228\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868730/extras/f11971ab6ccc8d223b2a987733c50d40.mp4?t=1752630228\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868730/extras/211f357a99cef6a718a4fe0536dca5fb.avif?t=1752630228\" alt=\"says the word feature, with tops on either side that look like downward arrows\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Meet the Neighbors</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You\u2019ve never met them, but that doesn\u2019t mean they weren\u2019t always out there.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Mysteries to Muster</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The world holds on tight to it\u2019s secrets, but it will help your journey to at least find a few.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">The Show Might Not Go On</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Help recover museum artifacts or a neighbor\u2019s vision will be forgotten to time...again.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Oyster World</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With a destination in mind, any path taken can lead you there, good luck.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868730/extras/b2ba49b9fc936b4f2ae927d66db5033a.poster.avif?t=1752630228\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868730/extras/b2ba49b9fc936b4f2ae927d66db5033a.webm?t=1752630228\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"h